From: Jiri Bohac <jbohac@suse.cz>
References: CVE-2026-72127 bsc#1277542
Patch-mainline: never, kabi 
Subject: kabi: fix for netdev-genl-report-NAPI-thread-PID-in-the-caller-s-pid-nam.patch

patches.suse/netdev-genl-report-NAPI-thread-PID-in-the-caller-s-pid-nam.patch
adds an include of net/net_namespace.h, changing some declarations into
definitions, breaking KABI as a result. Hide this from the KABI checker.

Signed-off-by: Jiri Bohac <jbohac@suse.cz>
Reviewed-by: Petr Pavlu <petr.pavlu@suse.com>

---
 net/core/netdev-genl.c |    2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

--- a/net/core/netdev-genl.c
+++ b/net/core/netdev-genl.c
@@ -2,7 +2,9 @@
 
 #include <linux/netdevice.h>
 #include <linux/notifier.h>
+#ifndef __GENKSYMS__
 #include <linux/pid_namespace.h>
+#endif
 #include <linux/rtnetlink.h>
 #include <net/busy_poll.h>
 #include <net/net_namespace.h>
